architecture standing-address-compiler
  canonical_name StandingAddressCompiler
  family commons
  domain Commons / Opportunity ranking
  layer commons
  semantic_question Which lawful opportunity is most relevant to this actor, in this territory, right now?
  purpose Ranking whose unit is an addressed opportunity rather than a content object. A feed of objects cannot say that one creator is two different things to do; an opportunity can. It also keeps the attention loop and the institutional loop apart, because a system that fed the second from the first would convert curiosity into commitments.
  maturity measured
  source_path engine/core/src/standing_address.c
  source_path engine/core/include/bf_standing_address.h
  source_path cmd/BonfyreStanding/src/main.c
  source_path cmd/BonfyreActors/tests/organ_callers_test.sh
